Radio Centre PIO 13
Message 75AF879
received 15h38 on priority channel
Signature : Bombardier "Silver star"

Major General Tyron Spirex

You have played well so far &.

We are flying over the Island of Alixia, we have spotted a
Littlestonian stronghold fighting against Katzarians who
outnumber them.
We are parachuting a reconnaissance vehicle in the allied
zone in order to evaluate the situation clearly.

These guys need help, it's obvious.
Take command of our base on the Island of Kristania to the
West of the objective and send reinforcements to Alixia.

If you succeed in bombarding the principal enemy sites,
the resistants may have a chance of getting out of it.

Claris Jackson asked me to say, 'Hello'. It appears that
you are the only person who could succeed in this mission.